only. Pseudos on `.interact-summary` will still show on the compact label."},"504":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-86","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#compact-interact","content":"To force compact label color (light themes need this so it stays white):"},"505":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-87","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#hold-contrast","content":"While holding, the letter keeps its idle color and gets a `--on-accent` stroke so it stays readable as `--primary` fills the key. If the fill and the letter are the same color, that stroke is what keeps E visible."},"506":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-88","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"This prompt is a world sprite, not a fullscreen NUI overlay."},"507":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-89","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"Keep `html, body` background transparent. `style.css` already does this."},"508":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-90","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"`backdrop-filter` cannot blur GTA. CEF only composites the DUI texture, so a blur with nothing behind it paints black. Use solid or slightly transparent `--surface` fills."},"509":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-91","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"Keep the layout compact. Large shadows and oversized rows read poorly in the world."},"510":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-92","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"Prefer `rem` over `px`. Animate `transform` and `opacity` only."},"511":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-93","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"DINPRO is self-hosted in `web/fonts/`. To use another face, add an `@font-face` in your theme file (see `legacy.css`) and set `--font`."},"512":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-94","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#dui-limits","content":"Built-in themes live in `web/themes/`. `modern.css` is the default HUD. `cyber.css`, `vice.css`, and `noir.css` show how far you can push shape without changing the HTML."},"513":{"id":"/docs/interact","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"page","content":"Sleepless Interact","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Free Resources","Interact"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact"},"514":{"id":"/docs/interact-0","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#features","content":"Features"},"515":{"id":"/docs/interact-1","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#dependencies","content":"Dependencies"},"516":{"id":"/docs/interact-2","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#ox_target-compatibility","content":"ox_target Compatibility"},"517":{"id":"/docs/interact-3","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#installation","content":"Installation"},"518":{"id":"/docs/interact-4","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#download-the-resource-step","content":"Download the Resource"},"519":{"id":"/docs/interact-5","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#add-to-server-step","content":"Add to Server"},"520":{"id":"/docs/interact-6","page_id":"/docs/interact","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/interact#configure-your-server-step","content":"Configure Your Server"},"521":{"id":"/docs/interact-7","page