ed for internal tracking and logging - it doesn't need to be an actual item in your inventory. Since custom rewards aren't real items, you must also provide `label` and `image` explicitly."},"1122":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-147","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lootbox/configuration#custom-reward-types","content":"Custom reward types require a registered reward hook to handle them. If no hook is registered, the system will fall back to default item behavior and log a warning."},"1123":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-148","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lootbox/configuration#how-custom-rewards-work","content":"When a player wins an item with a custom `rewardType`, the system looks for a registered hook for that type"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-149","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lootbox/configuration#how-custom-rewards-work","content":"If a hook exists and returns `true`, the hook handled the reward"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-150","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lootbox/configuration#how-custom-rewards-work","content":"If a hook returns `false`/`nil`, the system falls back to default item behavior"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-151","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lootbox/configuration#how-custom-rewards-work","content":"If no hook exists, a warning is logged and the system falls back to default item behavior"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-152","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/lootbox/configuration#how-custom-rewards-work","content":"This ensures rewards are never silently lost - if something isn't configured correctly, players still receive items."},"1128":{"id":"/docs/lootbox/configuration-153","page_id":"/docs/lootbox/configuratio